# Root-context builds (portal: builds the Rust API, whose Cargo.toml
# depends on ../services/rust-webdav-client — the context must be the repo
# root so that path dependency resolves). Keep the context lean: none of
# the excluded trees are read at build time.
.git
**/node_modules
**/target
backups
logs
output
state-opensme-agentic2
opensme-dev-agent
typesetting
tests
docs
contracts
specs
openspec
